{
  "date_key": "2026-11-22",
  "date_cn": "2026年11月22日",
  "day_cn": "周日",
  "english": "<div style=\"background:#eef5ff;border:1px solid #c7dcff;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 18px\"><div style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0d47a1;margin-bottom:8px\">🎧 双人地道对话发音</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#566;margin-bottom:9px\">A 男声 · B 女声 · 自然语速</div><audio controls preload=\"none\" style=\"width:100%\"><source src=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-22-dialogue.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><a href=\"https://gracieme.github.io/agent-for-news/audio/2026-11-22-dialogue.wav\" style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">▶ 播放或下载今日对话音频</a></div></div><div style=\"background:#e8f0fe;border-left:4px solid #1a73e8;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:15px\">【今日主题】</strong><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-weight:400;color:#1a73e8\">升职与谈薪 (Promotion, Salary Negotiation &amp; Self-advocacy)</span></div>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #0d47a1;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#0d47a1;font-size:15px\">【英文原文】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Hey, are you ready for your performance review tomorrow? I know you&#x27;ve been preparing to <strong>make a pitch for</strong> that Senior Manager role. You&#x27;ve definitely earned it.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Honestly, I&#x27;m a bit anxious. I&#x27;ve been doing the work of two people since Sarah left. I feel like I&#x27;m completely <strong>punching above my weight</strong>, but upper management just keeps <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">dragging their feet</span>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Well, tomorrow is the time to <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">lay it all on the line</span>. You really need to get comfortable enough to <strong>toot your own horn</strong>. Make a concrete list of all your recent successful campaigns. Remember, whatever you do, don&#x27;t <strong>sell yourself short</strong> when they ask about your target salary.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">I know, you&#x27;re right. It&#x27;s just incredibly frustrating because every time I bring up career progression, they somehow <strong>move the goalposts</strong> on what actually qualifies for a promotion. Or they just <strong>dangle a carrot</strong> about a phantom bonus scheme rolling out next quarter.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Classic corporate stalling tactics. I&#x27;ll <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">bet my bottom dollar</span> they&#x27;ll try to <strong>plead poverty</strong> and say the departmental budget is extremely tight this fiscal year.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Exactly! And I&#x27;m so tired of them trying to <strong>nickel and dime</strong> me on every little expense and benefit. I bring too much value to be treated like a junior. Actually, I have a competitive offer from a rival firm <span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">in my back pocket</span>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Oh, wow! That changes everything. When you go in there, you absolutely must <strong>stick to your guns</strong>.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">Oh, I will. I&#x27;m going to <strong>call their bluff</strong>. If they claim I&#x27;m indispensable, they can pay the market rate. If not, I&#x27;m handing in my notice.</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#e8f5e9;border-left:4px solid #1b5e20;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#1b5e20;font-size:15px\">【中文翻译】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">嘿，你准备好明天的绩效评估了吗？我知道你一直准备去（向老板）争取（make a pitch for）那个高级经理的职位。你绝对配得上。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">说实话，我有点焦虑。自从莎拉走后，我一个人干着两个人的活。我觉得自己完全是在超负荷/超级别发挥（punching above my weight），但高层就是一直在<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">拖拖拉拉</span>。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">那么，明天就是<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">和盘托出、全力以赴</span>的时候了。你真的需要习惯于自吹自擂/推销自己（toot your own horn）。把近期所有成功的营销活动列个具体的清单。记住，无论你怎么做，当他们问及你的目标薪资时，千万别把自己贱卖了/要价过低（sell yourself short）。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">我知道，你说得对。只是这让人无比沮丧，因为每次我提到职业晋升，他们总会不知怎么地随意改变晋升标准（move the goalposts）。或者他们干脆拿下个季度将要推出的虚无缥缈的奖金计划来吊我胃口（dangle a carrot）。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">典型的企业拖延战术。我<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">敢打包票</span>，他们肯定会哭穷（plead poverty），说这个财年的部门预算极其紧张。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">没错！我已经受够了他们在每一笔小额开销和福利上对我斤斤计较（nickel and dime）。我创造了太多的价值，不该被当成初级员工对待。实际上，我<span style=\"background:#f5f0e6;color:#8b7355;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.98em\">手头暗藏着</span>一份来自竞争对手公司的有竞争力的录用通知。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap\">A:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">哇哦！那情况就完全不一样了。你进去谈的时候，绝对必须坚持你的立场（stick to your guns）。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:5px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 6px 8px 0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#e53935;white-space:nowrap\">B:</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 0;font-size:14px;color:#333;line-height:1.7\">哦，我会的。我要揭穿他们的虚张声势/要求他们摊牌（call their bluff）。如果他们声称我是不可或缺的，那他们就得支付市场价。如果不行，我就递交辞呈。</td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"height:8px\"></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e5f5;border-left:4px solid #4a148c;padding:10px 16px;margin:18px 0 10px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0\"><strong style=\"color:#4a148c;font-size:15px\">【本日表达列表】</strong></div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">01.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>make a pitch for (something)</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 为（某事物）进行游说、争取（通常指通过陈述理由来推销自己或某个想法）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 职场中要求升职、加薪或争取项目预算时。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">02.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>punch above one&#x27;s weight</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 超水平发挥、承担超出自身级别/体量的责任（源自拳击术语：越级挑战）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 形容员工做着比当前职级更高、更难的工作，常作为升职的理由。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">03.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>toot one&#x27;s own horn</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 自吹自擂、宣传自己的成就、推销自己</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 职场绩效评估或面试中，鼓励求职者/员工大胆展示自身业绩，不需谦虚。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">04.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>sell oneself short</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 低估自己的价值、要价过低</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 在薪资谈判中，提醒对方不要因为缺乏自信而提出低于自身价值的薪资要求。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">05.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>move the goalposts</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 随意改变规则或标准（使他人难以达到目标）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 英国/全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 抱怨管理层在员工即将达成升职条件时，突然增加新的考核要求。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">06.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>dangle a carrot</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 用好处吊胃口、画大饼（源自用胡萝卜引诱驴子前进）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 公司用尚未兑现的加薪、奖金或期权来挽留员工，让员工继续卖力工作。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">07.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>plead poverty</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 哭穷、声称没有钱</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 谈判时雇主以“大环境不好”或“预算紧张”为借口拒绝涨薪。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">08.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>nickel and dime (someone)</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 在小钱上斤斤计较、通过反复克扣小额款项来剥削（某人）</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 美国通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 抱怨公司不仅不大幅涨薪，还在报销、小额福利上极其抠门。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">09.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>stick to one&#x27;s guns</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 坚持自己的立场/要求、不退让</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 在激烈的谈薪博弈中，鼓励对方咬死一个底线数字，不被HR的话术动摇。</span></td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:6px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"28\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 8px 10px 14px;color:#1a73e8;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:8px 0 0 8px;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-right:none\">10.</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:10px 14px 10px 8px;background:#f8f9ff;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid #d0d9ff;border-left:none\"><strong style=\"color:#1a73e8;font-size:14px\"><strong>call someone&#x27;s bluff</strong></strong><span style=\"color:#555;font-size:13px;margin-left:8px\">— 看穿对方的虚张声势、要求对方摊牌/兑现承诺</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f0fe;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#1a73e8;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">📍 全球通用</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;color:#2e7d32;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:6px\">💬 员工手握其他Offer去和老板谈判，测试老板是真重视自己愿意加薪，还是只想口头安抚。</span></td></tr></table>",
  "research": "<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #d9eef2;border-radius:10px;padding:20px 22px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#00838f,#26c6da);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin:-20px -22px 16px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.6px\">🎯 今日研究主线</div>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#546e7a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧭 选题方向：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Curriculum localization and domain legitimacy</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#6a1b9a;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🧷 对应草稿：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">Localizing Content, Presupposing English</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#1565c0;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🔎 检索主题：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">curriculum localization textbook language choice domain legitimacy multilingual participation</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#8e24aa;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">🪄 为什么是它：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">这是从跨国课程公平已自然长出的次级新方向。</td></tr></table>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:7px 0;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td width=\"88\" valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#2e7d32;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;padding-right:8px;white-space:nowrap\">✍️ 今天重点：</td><td valign=\"top\" style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;\">寻找能区分文化代表性与语言参与权的概念、教材审计方法和比较设计。</td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:5px 0;line-height:1.8;color:#555;font-size:13px;padding-left:96px\">（今天没有论文同时通过启发性、主线相关性与质量门槛。宁缺毋滥，明天再看。）</p>\n</div>",
  "mentor": "<p style=\"margin:6px 0;color:#555;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8\">（今日暂无可精读的论文，请稍后查看）</p>",
  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/hong-kong/politics/article/3375348/xis-bay-area-vision-offers-scope-cooperation-despite-us-tokyo-hurdles-analysts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">分析人士：尽管面临美日障碍，习近平的粤港澳大湾区愿景仍提供合作空间</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Xi’s bay-area vision offers scope for cooperation despite US, Tokyo hurdles: analysts</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">分析人士指出，尽管美国和日本对中国经济战略存在疑虑，但中国领导人习近平提出的粤港澳大湾区发展规划，依然为区域合作提供了广阔前景。此计划旨在促进香港、澳门和广东省九个城市间的经济融合，打造世界级城市群。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/11/22/2003868165\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国议员对美台关系前景感到乐观</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">US lawmaker upbeat on Taiwan ties</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一位美国国会议员近日对美国与台湾地区的关系发展表示乐观。在当前地缘政治背景下，美台关系的走向备受关注，特别是在经济和安全领域双方合作可能深化的背景下，此表态意义重大。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c63rgnq05pdwo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">BBC记者分析特朗普、习近平和普京历史性会谈的成果</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">BBC correspondents discuss what Trump, Xi and Putin got out of historic talks</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">BBC驻外记者团队深入探讨了美国前总统特朗普、中国国家主席习近平以及俄罗斯总统普京在历史性会谈中各自的得失。这些会谈在全球政治格局中产生了深远影响，记者们分析了各方如何利用这些接触实现其战略目标。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/11/19/chinas-efforts-to-strengthen-its-safety-net-fuel-public-anger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">中国加强社会保障的努力引发公众不满</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">China’s efforts to strengthen its safety net fuel public anger</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">中国政府为加强社会保障体系所做的努力，却在部分地区意外地引发了公众的不满。这表明在推行重要改革时，如何在政策设计与民众接受度之间取得平衡，仍是中国政府面临的一大挑战，值得深入关注。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/11/21/g-s1-154966/trump-contractors-congress\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普命令联邦承包商在回应国会前须请示白宫</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trump orders federal contractors to check with White House before responding to Congress</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国前总统特朗普曾发布指令，要求联邦政府承包商在回应国会的质询之前，必须先行向白宫请示。这一举动引发了对行政权力与立法监督之间制衡关系的讨论，对政府透明度及问责制构成潜在影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/national/2026/11/trump-summit-china-washington-week/689539/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普的中国峰会揭示了什么</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">What Trump’s Summit in China Reveals</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">本文分析了美国前总统特朗普在访问中国期间举行的峰会所揭示的深层信息。此次峰会不仅展示了中美两国在经贸和战略上的复杂关系，也反映出双方在处理国际事务上的不同策略和优先考量，值得深入解读。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/11/20/grand-theft-auto-power-play-osborn-review-geopolitics-video-games/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">各国在虚拟战场上进行着“严肃游戏”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">States Are Playing Serious Games on Virtual Battlefields</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">随着网络战和虚拟军事演习日益成为国家间竞争的焦点，本文探讨了各国如何利用虚拟空间进行战略博弈和技术对抗，这反映了现代冲突形态的转变及其潜在影响。（中立分析）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/11/21/trump-credit-cards-rates-warren\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">特朗普表示愿与民主党合作，为信用卡利息和费用设置上限</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Trump says he&#x27;d work with Dems to cap credit card interest, fees</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">美国前总统特朗普近日表态，称若再次当选，他愿意与民主党合作，共同推动立法以限制信用卡利息和各项费用，此举旨在争取中低收入选民支持，并可能对金融行业产生深远影响。（美国政治新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6wy0qj7w5zqo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">泽连斯基会见英国影子内阁成员时称，袭击克里米亚大桥是“公平回应”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Zelensky says Crimean Bridge strikes &#x27;fair response&#x27; as he meets UK&#x27;s Streeting</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">乌克兰总统泽连斯基在会见英国工党影子内阁成员时表示，对克里米亚大桥的袭击是“公平回应”，强调这是对俄罗斯行动的自卫反击，此言论可能进一步加剧地区紧张局势。（乌克兰官方）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC世界</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2026/nov/19/women-girls-rights-rape-sexual-violence-africa-marriage-unfpa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">联合国称全球四分之一女性无法拒绝婚内性行为</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">One in four women globally unable to refuse sex within marriage, says UN</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">联合国最新报告指出，全球约有四分之一的已婚女性无法自主决定是否进行婚内性行为，这凸显了全球范围内持续存在的性别不平等、家庭暴力以及女性身体自主权受侵犯的严峻现实。（联合国报告）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">卫报(英国,中左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/russian-helicopter-suspected-of-violating-finnish-airspace/a-80010133?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">俄罗斯直升机涉嫌侵犯芬兰领空</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Russian helicopter suspected of violating Finnish airspace</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">芬兰国防部报告称，一架俄罗斯直升机被怀疑侵犯了芬兰领空，芬兰军方已对此展开调查。此次事件正值芬兰加入北约之后，可能被视为俄罗斯对其邻国主权的一次潜在挑衅。（芬兰官方）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">DW(德国,中立)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261121-eisenkot-invites-netanyahu-s-party-for-marathon-israeli-coalition-talks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">艾森科特邀请内塔尼亚胡所在政党进行“马拉松式”以色列联合政府谈判</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Eisenkot invites Netanyahu’s party for ‘marathon’ Israeli coalition talks</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">以色列反对党国家团结党领导人甘茨的盟友艾森科特向总理内塔尼亚胡的利库德集团发出邀请，呼吁进行长时间的联合政府谈判，旨在打破当前政治僵局，以期组建更广泛的执政联盟，应对国家面临的挑战。（以色列政治新闻）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">法国24(法国)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/11/22/ukraine-dashcam-captures-massive-explosion-on-lviv-street\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">乌克兰：行车记录仪拍到利沃夫街头发生巨大爆炸</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Ukraine: Dashcam captures massive explosion on Lviv street</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一段行车记录仪视频记录了乌克兰西部城市利沃夫街头发生的猛烈爆炸，爆炸细节和影响尚不明确，但可能与俄乌冲突的最新进展有关，引发外界对当地安全局势的担忧。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">欧洲新闻台(泛欧)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌏 亚太视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2345014/3-inquirer-correspondents-win-big-at-bright-leaf-awards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">三名《问询者报》记者在“明亮树叶奖”中斩获大奖</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">3 Inquirer correspondents win big at Bright Leaf awards</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">《菲律宾每日问询者报》的三位记者在享有盛誉的“明亮树叶奖”评选中脱颖而出，获得重要奖项，这肯定了他们在新闻报道领域的卓越贡献和专业素养，提升了该报的行业影响力。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.straitstimes.com/asia/se-asia/from-murtabak-to-muscat-grapes-can-the-rts-link-draw-more-malaysians-to-singapore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">从馅饼到马斯喀特葡萄：新柔捷运系统能否吸引更多马来西亚人前往新加坡？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">From murtabak to Muscat grapes: Can the RTS Link draw more Malaysians to Singapore?</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">随着新柔捷运系统（RTS Link）即将开通，马来西亚和新加坡都在关注其对两国人员流动的潜在影响，特别是在吸引更多马来西亚游客和消费者前往新加坡方面，或将促进跨境经济活动。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">海峡时报(新加坡)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/news/2026/11/21/world/politics/uk-burnham-brexit-welfare-trump-iran/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">英国首相伯纳姆最担心并非脱欧或福利——而是特朗普和伊朗</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">British PM Burnham’s big worry Isn’t Brexit or welfare — it’s Trump and Iran</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国首相伯纳姆（虚构人名）目前最关注的并非国内的脱欧遗留问题或福利改革，而是国际政治中的两大不确定因素：美国前总统特朗普的潜在回归以及与伊朗的紧张关系，这些因素可能对英国外交政策构成重大挑战。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-11-22/karumba-barramundi-hatchery-releases-first-fingerlings-fishers/107408146\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">陷入困境的盲鲻鱼孵化场时隔多年首次放鱼</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Troubled barramundi hatchery releases first fish in years</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一家曾面临重重困难的盲鲻鱼孵化场在多年停滞后，终于成功释放了首批鱼苗，这标志着该机构在恢复运营和渔业资源可持续发展方面迈出了重要一步，对当地渔业生态具有积极意义。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/two-rulers-one-fort-pakistan-minister-invokes-humayun-sher-shah-at-sco-civilisational-forum/article71729569.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">“两位统治者，一座堡垒”：巴基斯坦部长在上海合作组织文明论坛上援引胡马雍与谢尔沙</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">‘Two rulers, one fort’: Pakistan Minister invokes Humayun, Sher Shah at SCO Civilisational Forum</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">巴基斯坦联邦部长在上海合作组织（SCO）文明论坛上，引用了莫卧儿王朝皇帝胡马雍与苏尔王朝谢尔沙的故事，以“两位统治者，一座堡垒”来阐述文明互鉴与地区合作的重要性，强调历史经验对当前国际关系的启示。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/sport/361060470/live-black-caps-v-india-first-cricket-test-basin-reserve-wellington\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新西兰板球队在第四天取得首个突破，印度队总分突破550</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Black Caps make first breakthrough on day four as India move past 550</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰板球队在与印度队的比赛第四天成功取得一个三柱门，而印度队则继续保持强劲势头，总得分已超过550分。这标志着一场激烈的板球对决，新西兰队正努力扭转劣势。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/11/22/newsroom-daily-quiz-sunday-22-november/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新闻编辑室每日测验，11月22日星期日</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Newsroom daily quiz, Sunday 22 November</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">这是新西兰媒体Newsroom在2020年11月22日发布的每日新闻测验，旨在测试读者对当天新闻事件的了解程度，涵盖国内外重要资讯，是检验新闻素养的互动方式。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/emergencies_local/2728240/four-people-injured-after-house-slides-off-piles-while-being-relocated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">房屋搬迁过程中滑离地基，造成四人受伤</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Four people injured after house slides off piles while being relocated</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在新西兰北岛怀卡托地区，一栋正在进行搬迁的房屋意外从其桩基上滑落，导致四人受伤。这起事故引发了对房屋搬迁作业安全规范的关注，以及相关责任的追查。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/21/bahrain-says-iranian-attack-hits-industrial-facility?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">巴林称伊朗袭击工业设施</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Bahrain says Iranian attack hits industrial facility</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">巴林政府宣称，该国一处工业设施遭到伊朗方面的袭击。这一事件可能加剧中东地区的地缘政治紧张局势，引发国际社会对区域稳定的担忧。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqpv94d10rwpo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">选举受挫后，非国大争取保住对南非关键城市的控制权</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">ANC fights to keep control of South Africa&#x27;s key cities after election setback</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">南非执政党非洲人国民大会（ANC）在近期地方选举中遭遇挫折后，正面临失去对主要城市控制权的挑战。此次选举结果反映出南非政治版图的变化，非国大亟需应对民意转向，以维持其长期执政地位。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckz749ey0r75o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">FBI十大通缉犯榜上有名的墨西哥毒枭在枪战中被捕</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Mexican drug lord on FBI&#x27;s 10 most wanted list arrested in shoot-out</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名被联邦调查局（FBI）列入十大通缉犯名单的墨西哥著名毒枭，在一次激烈的枪战中被捕。此次抓捕行动是打击国际贩毒集团的重要进展，对维护地区安全与稳定具有积极意义。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n</div></div>",
  "japanese": "<article class=\"jp-lesson\">\n<div class=\"jp-eyebrow\">每日一句 · N5 · 2026-11-22</div>\n<h2>🇯🇵 今天，学会一句日语</h2><p class=\"jp-scene\">计划下午去邮局办理事务</p>\n<div class=\"jp-sentence\" lang=\"ja\"><ruby>今日<rp>（</rp><rt>きょう</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>の<ruby>午後<rp>（</rp><rt>ごご</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>、<ruby>郵便局<rp>（</rp><rt>ゆうびんきょく</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>へ<ruby>荷物<rp>（</rp><rt>にもつ</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>を<ruby>出し<rp>（</rp><rt>だし</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>に<ruby>行きます<rp>（</rp><rt>いきます</rt><rp>）</rp></ruby>。</div>\n<p class=\"jp-kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうのごご、ゆうびんきょくへにもつをだしにいきます。</p>\n<p class=\"jp-translation\">今天下午我要去邮局寄包裹。</p>\n<div class=\"jp-audio\"><div class=\"jp-player\"><label for=\"jp-normal\">正常语速</label><audio id=\"jp-normal\" controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"正常语速\"><source src=\"audio/2026-11-22-japanese-normal.wav?v=2b56cf8c76cf\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><label class=\"jp-loop\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-jp-loop=\"jp-normal\"> 循环跟读</label></div><div class=\"jp-player\"><label for=\"jp-slow\">慢速跟读</label><audio id=\"jp-slow\" controls preload=\"none\" aria-label=\"慢速跟读\"><source src=\"audio/2026-11-22-japanese-slow.wav?v=2b56cf8c76cf\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio><label class=\"jp-loop\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-jp-loop=\"jp-slow\"> 循环跟读</label></div></div>\n<section><h3>🧩 中文语法拆解 · <span lang=\"ja\">～に行きます</span></h3>\n<p class=\"jp-structure\">「今日の午後」（时间状语）+「郵便局へ」（方向/目的地）+「荷物を」（动作宾语）+「出しに行きます」（移动目的与谓语）。句中省略了第一人称主语「私は」。</p><p>助词「の」连接时间名词，意为“今天下午”。助词「へ」（读作え）接在场所「郵便局」后，表示移动的方向与目的地。助词「を」提示宾语「荷物」。重点句型「～に行きます」表示“去做某事”，前面接动词ます形去掉ます的形式（动词连用形）或动作性名词，表示移动的目的；助词「に」在此表示行动目的。本句动词变形过程为：一类动词原形「出す」（寄出）→ ます形「出します」→ 除去「ます」保留「出し」，后接「に行きます」构成「出しに行きます」（去寄）。</p></section>\n<section><h3>📖 句中词汇</h3><div class=\"jp-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>日语</th><th>假名</th><th>中文与词性</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td lang=\"ja\">郵便局</td><td lang=\"ja\">ゆうびんきょく</td><td>邮局（名词）</td></tr><tr><td lang=\"ja\">荷物</td><td lang=\"ja\">にもつ</td><td>包裹，行李（名词）</td></tr><tr><td lang=\"ja\">出す</td><td lang=\"ja\">だす</td><td>寄出，拿出（一类动词/他动词）</td></tr><tr><td lang=\"ja\">午後</td><td lang=\"ja\">ごご</td><td>下午（名词）</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>\n<section><h3>✏️ 试着说一句</h3><p>明天去超市买牛奶。</p>\n<details><summary>查看参考答案</summary><p>明日、スーパーへ牛乳を買いに行きます。（あした、すーぱーへぎゅうにゅうをかいにいきます。／明天去超市买牛奶。）</p></details></section>\n<p class=\"jp-note\">N5 / N4 隔日交替 · 等级为教学参考 · 每天奥克兰时间早上 8 点开始更新</p>\n</article>"
}
